msgstr "Ezabatu fitxategi guztiak ordezkaritza honetan (biak .mo eta .po)?"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:202
msgid "No override files uploaded yet."
msgstr "Oraindik ez da ordezkaritza fitxategirik kargatu."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:220
msgid "Upload .mo file"
msgstr "Kargatu .mo fitxategia"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:232
msgid ""
"Accepts compiled .mo files only. Filename must follow the pattern "
"{textdomain}-{locale}.mo. Uploading a file with the same name as an existing "
"one will replace it."
msgstr ""
"Only konpilatutako .mo fitxategiak onartzen dira. Fitxategiak {textdomain}-"
"{locale}.mo eredua jarraitu behar du. Fitxategi batek izen bera badu beste "
"batekin, ordeztuko du."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:239
msgid "Upload Override"
msgstr "Kargatu Ordezkaketa"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:248
msgid "Loco Translate — Copy to Safe Storage"
msgstr "Loco Translate — Kopiatu Segurtasun Gunean"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:252
msgid ""
"Loco Translate stores its custom translations in wp-content/languages/loco/ "
"— a location that can be silently wiped by a WP core update, plugin "
"reinstall, or if Loco Translate itself is removed. Copying files here moves "
"them into the Lingua Forge i18n-overrides directory, which persists through "
"all of those events and is loaded automatically on every request."
msgstr ""
"Loco Translate bere itzulpen pertsonalak wp-content/languages/loco/ kokatzen "
"ditu — leku hori WP eguneraketak, plugina berrabiarazteak edo Loco Translate "
"ezabatzeak ezabatzen du. Fitxategiak hemen kopiatzeak Lingua Forge i18n-"
"overrides direktorioan jartzen ditu, eta horrek iraun duzuen bitartean "
"mantentzen da, eta automatikoki kargatzen da eskaera bakoitzean."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:263
msgid "File copied to safe storage successfully."
msgstr "Fitxategia arrakastaz kopiatuta segurtasun gunean."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:268
msgid "Source file not found."
msgstr "Iturri fitxategia ez da aurkitu."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:269
msgid "Could not copy the file. Check that the uploads folder is writable."
msgstr "Ez da fitxategia kopiatzen. Egiaztatu upload karpeta idazgarria dela."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:270
msgid "Invalid file reference."
msgstr "Fitxategi erreferentzia baliogabea."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:286
msgid "Type"
msgstr "Mota"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:307
msgid "✓ In safe storage"
msgstr "✓ Segurtasun gunean"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:320
msgid "Copy to safe storage"
msgstr "Kopiatu segurtasun gunean"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:333
msgid ""
"No custom Loco Translate files found yet. They appear here once you save a "
"translation in Loco Translate."
msgstr ""
"Oraindik ez da Loco Translate fitxategirik aurkitu. Itzulpena gordetzen "
"duzunean agertzen da hemen."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:343
msgid "AI Cache"
msgstr "AI Cache"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:347
msgid ""
"Lingua Forge caches AI-generated translations, meta descriptions, excerpts, "
"and generated content per-post so unchanged inputs do not re-trigger a paid "
"API call. Cached entries are automatically invalidated when their inputs "
"change. Clear the cache manually to reclaim database space, force a resync "
"after switching providers or editing prompt templates, or troubleshoot a "
"cache-related issue."
msgstr ""
"Lingua Forge-k AI-k sortutako itzulpenak, meta deskribapenak, pasarteak eta "
"eduki sortuak cache-etan gordetzen ditu, sarrera aldaketek API ordainpeko "
"deia berriro ez eragiteko. Cache-ak automatikoki ezabatzen dira sarrera "
"aldaketak gertatzen direnean. Garbitu cachea eskuz, datu-baseko espazioa "
"berreskuratzeko, hornitzailea aldatzean edo prompt txantiloiak editatzean, "
"edo cache-arekin arazo bat izanez gero."

#. translators: %d is the number of cleared cache entries.
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:365
#, php-format
msgid "AI cache cleared. %d entry was removed."
msgid_plural "AI cache cleared. %d entries were removed."
msgstr[0] "AI cachea garbitu da. %d sarrera ezabatu da."
msgstr[1] "AI cachea garbitu da. %d sarrera ezabatu dira."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:381
msgid ""
"Clear all cached AI results? Future requests will trigger fresh API calls "
"until the cache rebuilds."
msgstr ""
"Garbitu AI cacheko emaitza guztiak? Etorkizuneko eskaerak API deia berriro "
"eragingo du cachea berritzen den arte."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:387
msgid "Clear AI Cache"
msgstr "Garbitu AI Cache"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:397
msgid "Debug Files"
msgstr "Debug Fitxategiak"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:401
msgid ""
"When debug logging is enabled (via the toggle below or by defining "
"LINGUAFORGE_AI_DEBUG in wp-config.php), the Translation and FSE template "
"translation features write their raw AI prompts and responses to disk for "
"troubleshooting. Use this section to monitor that output and clear it once "
"you have what you need — the files can grow quickly on large pages. "
"Configure the destination directory via the linguaforge_debug_dir filter."
msgstr ""
"Debug log-ak aktibatuta dagoenean (beheko toggle bidez edo wp-config.php-n "
"LINGUAFORGE_AI_DEBUG definituz), Itzulpen eta FSE txantiloi itzulpen "
"ezaugarriak AI prompt eta erantzunak diskoan idazten dituzte arazteak "
"egiteko. Erabili atal hau irteera hori monitorizatzeko eta garbitu behar "
"duzunean — fitxategiak azkar handitzen dira orri handietan. Konfiguratu "
"helbide direktorioa linguaforge_debug_dir iragazkiaren bidez."

#. translators: %d is the number of removed debug files.
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:428
#, php-format
msgid "Debug files cleared. %d file was removed."
msgid_plural "Debug files cleared. %d files were removed."
msgstr[0] "Debug fitxategiak garbitu dira. %d fitxategi bat kendu da."
msgstr[1] "Debug fitxategiak garbitu dira. %d fitxategi kendu dira."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:449
msgid "Debug logging enabled."
msgstr "Debug log-ak aktibatuta daude."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:451
msgid "Debug logging disabled."
msgstr "Debug log-ak desaktibatuta daude."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:467
msgid "Debug logging"
msgstr "Debug log-ak"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:478
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:499
msgid "Write AI prompts and responses to disk for troubleshooting"
msgstr "AI prompt eta erantzunak diskoan idaztea arazteak egiteko"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:483
msgid ""
"Forced ON by the LINGUAFORGE_AI_DEBUG constant in wp-config.php. Remove that "
"line to control this toggle from here."
msgstr ""
"Linguaforge_AI_DEBUG konstanteak wp-config.php-n behartu du. Lerro hori "
"ezabatu toggle hau kontrolatzeko hemen."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:485
msgid ""
"Forced OFF by the LINGUAFORGE_AI_DEBUG constant in wp-config.php. Remove "
"that line to control this toggle from here."
msgstr ""
"Linguaforge_AI_DEBUG konstanteak wp-config.php-n behartu du. Lerro hori "
"ezabatu toggle hau kontrolatzeko hemen."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:503
msgid ""
"Files land in the directory below. Useful for diagnosing translation issues "
"— turn off once you have what you need so the files do not accumulate. You "
"can also force this from wp-config.php with `define( 'LINGUAFORGE_AI_DEBUG', "
"true );` which overrides the toggle."
msgstr ""
"Fitxategiak beheko direktorian kokatzen dira. Itzulpen arazoak "
"diagnostikatzeko erabilgarria — itzali behar duzu behar duzuna lortu arte, "
"bestela fitxategiak handitzen dira. Hau behartu dezakezu wp-config.php-tik "
"`define( 'LINGUAFORGE_AI_DEBUG', true );` erabiliz, toggle hori gainetik."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:510
msgid "Currently:"
msgstr "Unean"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:513
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:617
msgid "✓ Enabled"
msgstr "✓ Aktibatuta"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:517
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:621
msgid "✗ Disabled"
msgstr "✗ Desaktibatuta"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:524
msgid "Directory"
msgstr "Direktorioa"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:528
msgid ""
"Filter with linguaforge_debug_dir to redirect debug output to a non-public "
"location."
msgstr ""
"Filtratu linguaforge_debug_dir erabiliz, debug irteera ezkutuko kokapen "
"batera bideratzeko."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:536
msgid ".txt file(s) in the directory"
msgstr "Direktorioan .txt fitxategi(a)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:543
msgid "Save Debug Setting"
msgstr "Gorde Debug Konfigurazioa"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:554
msgid ""
"Delete all .txt files in the debug directory? The directory itself will "
"remain so future debug writes still land cleanly."
msgstr ""
"Ezabatu debug direktorioan dauden .txt fitxategi guztiak? Direktorioa bera "
"geratuko da, etorkizuneko debug idatziak garbi iritsi daitezen."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:560
msgid "Clear Debug Files"
msgstr "Garbitu Debug Fitxategiak"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:575
msgid ""
"Per-block translation cache shared across posts. Configure on/off in "
"Settings → Behavior. Stats below show what is currently cached; clearing "
"forces every block to be re-translated on next request (useful after "
"upgrading models or to recover database space)."
msgstr ""
"Bloke bakoitzeko itzulpen cachea partekatzen da posten artean. Konfiguratu "
"piztu/itzali Ezarpenetan → Portaera. Beheko estatistikek erakusten dute zer "
"cacheatzen den une honetan; garbitzeak bloke bakoitza berriro itzultzea "
"behartzen du hurrengo eskaeran (baliozkoa modeloak eguneratu ondoren edo "
"datu-baseko espazioa berreskuratzeko)."

#. translators: %d is the number of removed cached blocks.
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:593
#, php-format
msgid "Translation Memory cleared. %d cached block was removed."
msgid_plural "Translation Memory cleared. %d cached blocks were removed."
msgstr[0] "Itzulpen Memoria garbitu da. %d cacheatutako blokea kendu da."
msgstr[1] "Itzulpen Memoria garbitu da. %d cacheatutako bloke kendu dira."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:613
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Egoera"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:623
msgid "— toggle in Settings → Behavior."
msgstr "— toggle Ezarpenetan → Portaeran."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:628
msgid "Cached blocks"
msgstr "Cacheatutako blokeak"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:634
msgid "Cumulative cache hits"
msgstr "Bilketa cacheko iristeak"

#. translators: %s is the average hits per cached block.
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:642
#, php-format
msgid "(avg %.1f hits/block)"
msgstr "(batez besteko %.1f iriste/blokea)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:651
msgid "Oldest entry"
msgstr "Goreneko sarrera"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:655
msgid "Newest entry"
msgstr "Azkeneko sarrera"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:660
msgid "Approximate size"
msgstr "Tamaina hurbila"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:672
msgid ""
"Clear the entire Translation Memory? Future translations will rebuild the "
"cache as they run."
msgstr ""
"Garbitu Itzulpen Memoria osoa? Etorkizuneko itzulpenek cachea berriro "
"eraikiko dute."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:678
msgid "Clear Translation Memory"
msgstr "Garbitu Itzulpen Memoria"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:689
msgid "Uninstall Behaviour"
msgstr "Desinstalazio Portaera"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:693
msgid ""
"Controls what happens when an administrator deletes the plugin from Plugins "
"→ Installed Plugins → Delete. Plugin settings and AI caches are always "
"removed. Language assignments and translation relationships are kept by "
"default so an accidental uninstall or a reinstall can pick up where it left "
"off."
msgstr ""
"Kudeatzen du zer gertatzen den administratzaileak plugin-a ezabatzen duenean "
"Plugins → Installed Plugins → Delete. Pluginaren ezarpenak eta AI cache-ak "
"beti ezabatzen dira. Hizkuntza esleipenak eta itzulpen harremanak mantentzen "
"dira lehenetsita, beraz, desinstalazio edo berrinstalazio batetik bertara "
"itzuli daiteke."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:704
msgid "Uninstall setting saved."
msgstr "Desinstalazio ezarpena gorde da."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:717
msgid "Delete content data on uninstall"
msgstr "Ezabatu edukien datuak desinstalazioan"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:726
msgid ""
"Also delete language assignments, translation relationships, meta "
"descriptions, glossary, and Translation Memory when the plugin is uninstalled"
msgstr ""
"Era berean, ezabatu hizkuntza esleipenak, itzulpen harremanak, meta "
"deskribapenak, glosarioa eta Itzulpen Memoria plugin-a desinstalatzen denean."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:729
msgid "Warning:"
msgstr "Abisua:"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:731
msgid ""
"If checked, uninstalling the plugin will permanently delete all language "
"assignments, translation relationships, meta descriptions, per-page presets, "
"the AI glossary, and Translation Memory for every post on this site. This "
"cannot be undone. Leave unchecked unless you are fully removing multilingual "
"support from the site."
msgstr ""
"Egiaztatzen baduzu, plugin-a desinstalatzen duzunean, hizkuntza esleipen "
"guztiak, itzulpen harremanak, meta deskribapenak, orrialdeko aurresetak, AI "
"glosarioa eta Itzulpen Memoria betirako ezabatuko dira gune honetan. Hau "
"ezin da desegin. Ez egiaztatu, gunean aniztasun hizkuntzak guztiz ezabatu "
"nahi baduzu."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:742
msgid "Save Uninstall Setting"
msgstr "Gorde Desinstalazio Ezarpena"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:37
#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:552
msgid "Router"
msgstr "Router"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:92
msgid "Primary language saved."
msgstr "Hizkuntza nagusia gorde da."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:97
msgid "Permalink rules flushed successfully."
msgstr "Permalinka arauak arrakastaz bideratu dira."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:102
msgid "Primary Language"
msgstr "Hizkuntza Nagusia"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:105
msgid ""
"The primary language is always served at the root of your site — no URL "
"prefix in path mode, no language subdomain in subdomain mode. All other "
"languages use either a /lang/ path prefix (e.g. example.com/de/) or a "
"language subdomain (e.g. de.example.com), depending on the URL structure "
"setting below."
msgstr ""
"Hizkuntza nagusia beti zerbitzatzen da zure gunearen erroan — ez URL "
"aurrizkia bide moduan, ez hizkuntza azpian domeinua moduan. Beste hizkuntzak "
"edo /lang/ bide aurrizkia (adibidez example.com/de/) edo hizkuntza azpian "
"domeinua (de.example.com) erabiltzen dituzte, beheko URL egitura ezarpenaren "
